Josh: For TS, prefer Fetch + ReadableStream example rather than Node-only event emitter. Also show the retry wrapper returning an async iterable.

Maya: Added this TS snippet (async iterator + exponential backoff):
```ts
async function* retryStream(fetchFn: () => Promise<ReadableStream>, max=3) {
  let attempt = 0;
  while (true) {
    try {
      const stream = await fetchFn();
      const reader = stream.getReader();
      while (true) {
        const { value, done } = await reader.read();
        if (done) return;
        yield value;
      }
    } catch (e) {
      attempt++;
      if (attempt >= max) throw e;
      await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 200 * 2 ** (attempt - 1)));
    }
  }
}
```

